// E2E test for `Program package` in a REPL with no project (BT-3651, BT-3661).
//
// The aggregate REPL-protocol session is a bare REPL: no launcher recorded a
// `root_package`, so `Program package` must raise a structured error naming the
// missing package, never answer `nil` (ADR 0129 / principles §4). The
// single-package, library-project and ambiguous-package contexts are covered
// by EUnit (`beamtalk_program_tests`, `beamtalk_package_tests`) and the CLI
// launcher unit tests in `repl_startup.rs`.

Program package
// => ERROR: This program has no root package
